      "section_kind": "interpretive_questions",
      "section_title": "What does the register accomplish?",
      "text": "The register is more than a headcount: its family groups, priestly qualifications, temple servants, singers, animals, and gifts make an administrative claim about the continuity and organization of the returned community. At the same time, differences from the parallel Ezra 2 list and uncertainty about ancient counting mean that the totals should not be treated as a precise modern census without qualification.",
